,"1.2 向量的线性运算","1.2.3 向量数乘"],"id":"第1章 向量与几何测量 / 1.2 向量的线性运算 / 1.2.3 向量数乘::1::sha256:97c86f565c4e7e22e53b929cd529fa89bb2f2618a16a3d709697feba599fc875","start_line":113,"text":"#### 1.2.3 向量数乘\n\n定义 1.7（数乘，标量乘法） 设 k 是一个实数（标量），$a = (x, y)$ 是一个向量，则 k 与 a 的数乘为：\n$$\nk \\cdot a = (kx, ky)\n$$\n几何解释：数乘就是缩放——把箭头的长度变为原来的 $|k|$ 倍；若 $k < 0$，则同时反转方向。\n\n| k 的值 | 几何效果 |\n| --- | --- |\n| $k > 1$ | 拉伸（伸长） |\n| 0 $< k < 1$ | 压缩（缩短） |\n| $k = -1$ | 反向，长度不变 |\n| $k < 0$ | 反向且缩放 |\n\n定义 1.8（共线） 如果存在实数 k 使得 $b = k \\cdot a$，则称 a 与 b 共线（方向相同或相反）。此时 b 的箭头落在 a 所在的直线上。"}]},"status":"reviewed","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":2,"required_sections":["definition","formula","worked_examples","geometric_meaning"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.ops.scalar","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_1_a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_1_ka","kind":"vector","label":"2a","role":"result","value":[2,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_2_a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[2,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_2_ka","kind":"vector","label":"0.5a","role":"result","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_3_a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_3_ka","kind":"vector","label":"-1a","role":"result","value":[-1,-2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_4_a","kind":"vector","label":"a","role":"vector_a","value":[1,-1]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"dimension":2,"id":"scalar_4_ka","kind":"vector","label":"-2a","role":"result","value":[-2,2]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.ops.scalar"],"id":"rel.scalar.1","kind":"scalar_multiple","parameters":{"scalar":2},"source_